	"changelog": "### 1.0.5\n* Removed the automatic capitals for the first word of a sentence and for a lone i. In browser editors such as the one on claude.ai, they could change the wrong word or lose text you were typing.\n* Text replacements now happen when you pause typing. Keys you press while Typix swaps the text are held and typed right after it, so nothing you type gets lost.\n* Spelling now follows the keyboard layout you are typing with in WhatsApp and other WebView2 apps.\n\n### 1.0.4\n* The spelling command now finds a misspelled word that automatic capitals have just capitalised, instead of opening statistics.\n* Choosing a suggestion after typing on past the word now replaces it in Chrome instead of saying it could not be selected.\n\n### 1.0.3\n* Typix no longer mutes NVDA while it replaces a word, so a line from a game or a chat message arriving at that moment is still spoken. Only the selection stays unspoken.\n* After Add to dictionary or Skip, the spelling command no longer offers the same word again.\n* Automatic capitals, text replacements and spelling fixes now work in Chrome, which takes a moment to apply a selection.\n\n### 1.0.2\n* Fixed NVDA missing what an app says right after you press Enter, as in a MUD, when the command was the first word of a sentence or a shortcut. Words you end with Enter are now left alone without muting speech.\n\n### 1.0.1\n* Typing statistics now open in a read-only field with a Close button: a short summary on the first line, then details for today, the last 7 days, all time and each recent day.\n* Words you finish with Enter now count in the statistics.\n\n### 1.0.0\n* First public release.\n* Typing sounds in text fields, with stereo position and pitch for each character, bundled mechanical keyboard packs, and a pack editor.\n* Beep on misspelled words, spelling suggestions, and a custom dictionary.\n* Text replacements and automatic capitals.\n* Whole word echo after a correction, and typing statistics.\n* English and Ukrainian interface and help.\n* Needs NVDA 2026.1 or later.",
	"licenseURL": "https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-2.0.html",
	"submissionTime": 1795257467000,
	"translations": [
		{
			"language": "uk",
			"displayName": "Typix",
			"description": "Typix відтворює звуки набору в текстових полях, з окремими звуками для літер, великих літер, пробілу, Enter, Tab, Backspace, Delete і розділових знаків. Кожен символ може мати власне положення в стереопанорамі та власну висоту. У комплекті є пакети звуків механічних клавіатур і редактор для створення власних, а ще Typix може подавати сигнал про слова з помилками."
		}
